# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:58
translate english talk1_ecac491f:

    # "L站在囚室门前，看见坐在床上的夜神月转动了一下头的角度，直直地注视向他的方向。"
    "L stood in front of the door and saw Light, sitting on the bed, turned his head to stare straight at him."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:61
translate english talk1_7bddc42c:

    # Y renzhen "今天是几月几日？为什么突然转移了我的牢房？如果我记得没错的话，死刑立即执行的判决要生效了吧？"
    Y renzhen "What is the date today? Why was I suddenly moved into a different place? If I remember correctly, the death warrant should be carried out soon, right?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:63
translate english talk1_3bd961c9:

    # "果然，夜神月敏锐地察觉到了变动。"
    "As expected, Light had noticed the changes keenly."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:64
translate english talk1_5963c497:

    # L pt "不用很快被处死不是夜神君的愿望吗？在执行死刑之前，你都会在这里。"
    L pt "Wasn't it your wish not to be executed so soon, Yagami-kun? Before the execution is carried out, you should remain here."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:66
translate english talk1_7d806ef9:

    # Y renzhen "别开玩笑了，L，如果没有发生意外，“Kira”这种等级的囚犯怎么可能随意移动？究竟发生了什么？"
    Y renzhen "Stop joking, L. If nothing went wrong, how could a prisoner with Kira's identity be moved so casually? What exactly happened?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:69
translate english talk1_5cbae37b:

    # "看来夜神月已经对你的隐瞒起了疑心。"
    "It seemed Light had become suspicious of your secrecy."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:74
translate english talk1_d11ee32d:

    # L order2 "这不是夜神君能知道的事情，请你不要忘记自己的身份，身为囚犯就要有囚犯的自觉。"
    L order2 "It's not something Yagami-kun needs to know. Please don't forget where you stand—as a prisoner, you should act like that."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:77
translate english talk1_6b94bdba:

    # Y angry "你这家伙……"
    Y angry "You bastard..."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:80
translate english talk1_b8bd061f:

    # "夜神月的目光在你的身上剜过，带着深重的厌恶与憎恨之情。"
    "Light's gaze cut through you, filled with deep disgust and hatred."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:82
translate english talk1_4c3e5ac2:

    # "L无视了这目光，转身离开了。"
    "L ignored the look and turned to leave."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:89
translate english talk1_a1c15d1f:

    # L pt "现在的夜神君还没有权限知道这种事情，可以告诉你的是，你不一定会被判处死刑。"
    L pt "Yagami-kun, you don't have the permission to know such things yet. What I can tell you is that you may not necessarily be sentenced to death."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:89
translate english talk1_32800ae4:

    # L pt "关于Kira要被如何处置，国际上讨论的声音还是很激烈，成为了程序正义和结果正义之争。"
    L pt "The international debate over how Kira should be dealt with remained intense, becoming a dispute between procedural justice and substantive justice."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:89
translate english talk1_0fefaa32:

    # L pt "无论如何，Kira确实降低了犯罪率，阻止了战争的发生。这是历史上没有其他人可以做到的。"
    L pt "In any case, Kira did reduce crime rate and prevent wars from breaking out. No one else in history had been able to achieve this."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:94
translate english talk1_89298282:

    # "夜神月听见这番话神色和缓了一些。"
    "Hearing this, Light's expression softened slightly."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:95
translate english talk1_fb62280f:

    # Y "所以我现在被移交给你，一个中立的第三方进行管理……吗？"
    Y "So I've ended up in your hands — the so-called neutral third party… lucky you, huh?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:96
translate english talk1_406ffeda:

    # L pt "可以这么说。"
    L pt "You could say that."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:97
translate english talk1_4bb1921a:

    # "L暧昧不清地说道。"
    "L said ambiguously."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:98
translate english talk1_3622275e:

    # Y "我知道了。"
    Y "I see."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:99
translate english talk1_3fa28a5b:

    # "夜神月没有继续交流的意愿。"
    "Light showed no intention to continue the conversation."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:99
translate english talk1_8657a1de:

    # "L转身离开了。"
    "L turned and left."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:111
translate english talk2_c03b8b75:

    # "L走进囚室的时候，月少见地站着，面对着墙壁不知道在想什么。"
    "When L entered, Light was unusually standing, facing the wall, lost in thought."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:112
translate english talk2_35c4f28b:

    # L "真稀奇呢。"
    L "How unusual."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:114
translate english talk2_7160caf5:

    # "月像是知道L在想什么一般接上了对话。"
    "Light continued the conversation, just like he knew what L was thinking."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:116
translate english talk2_a00ba906:

    # Y "总是坐着和躺着腿部的肌肉也会酸痛发麻吧。我不喜欢血液循环不通的感觉。"
    Y "Even just sitting or lying down all the time makes my legs ache and go numb. I really can't stand that poor circulation feeling… you know, right?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:118
translate english talk2_1e8d847f:

    # L "这样啊。"
    L "I see."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:120
translate english talk2_dd77782f:

    # L order2 "说起来，夜神君知道吗，夜神局长因为抓捕Kira有功，被擢升成了次长呢。"
    L order2 "By the way, Yagami-kun. Did you know that Mr.Yagami has been promoted to deputy director due to his contributions in capturing Kira?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:122
translate english talk2_8754f1bb:

    # "月的表情出现了一瞬间的动摇，但是很快又回归平静了。"
    "Light's expression wavered for a moment but quickly returned to calm."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:124
translate english talk2_fc025ef0:

    # Y "……"
    Y "……"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:126
translate english talk2_450e11c2:

    # Y "你想从我这里得到什么反应？"
    Y "So what kind of reaction do you actually want from me?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:128
translate english talk2_e6f16d49:

    # L smile2 "啊，被识破了。"
    L smile2 "Ah, so you figured me out."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:130
translate english talk2_4ab89abc:

    # Y jiaoji2 "说什么“啊，被识破了”啊……"
    Y jiaoji2 "What's with the “Ah, you figured me out”…?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:133
translate english talk2_ac58dab0:

    # "月突然向L逼近了两步，眉眼俊美到锋利，那双褐色的眼睛里沉淀着令人惊心的怒意。"
    "Light suddenly took a step closer to L. His sharp features were striking, and his brown eyes held a terrifying anger."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:135
translate english talk2_74931731:

    # Y jiaoji1 "父亲绝对不会以这件事情为荣，当然，这次是我输了，但是你这家伙也不要得意忘形了……！"
    Y jiaoji1 "Father would never be proud of this. Sure, I lost this time, but don't get cocky, you bastard…!"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:135
translate english talk2_7cc00751:

    # Y jiaoji1 "我不知道你为什么转移我的囚室，但是我也不会觉得你安了什么好心，无论如何不要动我的家人，这是你和我的事情！"
    Y jiaoji1 "I don't know why you moved me from my previous cell, but don't think for a second that I believe you have good intentions. No matter what, don't touch my family—this is between you and me!"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:139
translate english talk2_3f21b55f:

    # L pt "……"
    L pt "……"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:142
translate english talk2_3911f8eb:

    # "看来提起夜神总一郎的事情被对方误会成威胁了。自己的形象究竟被妖魔化成了什么样子啊。"
    "It seems that mentioning Soichiro Yagami was misunderstood as a threat. Just how demonized has my image become."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:147
translate english talk2_32b3b4fa:

    # L "夜神君对父亲很了解呢，夜神局长在升职的第二天就提交了辞呈。"
    L "Light knew his father very well. Mr.Yagami had submitted his resignation the day after he was promoted."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:147
translate english talk2_e8578d47:

    # L "他对令自己骄傲的儿子竟然是Kira非常震惊和自责，以他的品性是不会用抓捕儿子作为功勋升职的。"
    L "He was shocked and full of guilt that his son, whom he had been proud of, turned out to be Kira. Considering his character, he would never use capturing his own son as a merit for promotion."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:151
translate english talk2_5eec6f9e:

    # Y fadai "父亲他……"
    Y fadai "Father..."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:153
translate english talk2_bec07746:

    # "青年低下了头，神情复杂。"
    "The young man lowered his head, his facial expression was complicated."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:159
translate english talk2_6ba7a287:

    # "看来夜神君很信任自己的父亲呢，那就没有必要说夜神局长在擢升之后辞职的事情了吧。L想。"
    "It seems Light trusts his father deeply. In that case, there's no need to mention Chief Yagami's resignation after his promotion, L thought."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:161
translate english talk2_0c1adf03:

    # L "夜神君多虑了，我也是有我的原则和底线的。"
    L "Yagami-kun, you are overthinking. I also have my principles and rules."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:163
translate english talk2_55fe6e78:

    # Y renzhen "在我家装监控摄像头的人原来这么有操守啊。"
    Y renzhen "Wow, who knew the guy who set up the cameras in my house had such integrity?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:165
translate english talk2_8ba137ce:

    # L "这是夜神局长同意的调查手段，夜神君不用偷换概念。"
    L "This was an investigation method agreed by Mr. Yagami. Yagami-kun, please don't twist the facts."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:167
translate english talk2_8f320638:

    # Y renzhen "是吗，那你现在观察到我的反应了，你满意了吗？"
    Y renzhen "Is that so? Well, now you've seen my reaction. Are you satisfied now."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:169
translate english talk2_2ab0f05f:

    # L "很满意。夜神君还留有之前的部分真是太好了，不再伪装的这样的正义感很棒呢。"
    L "Very satisfied. I'm glad to see you still have that genuine sense of justice without pretense, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:171
translate english talk2_195225ea:

    # Y "被你夸奖还真是令人恶心啊。"
    Y "Being praised by you is honestly disgusting."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:173
translate english talk2_15a3536a:

    # L "我已经开始期待下一次和夜神君的聊天了。"
    L "I'm already looking forward to my next conversation with Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:175
translate english talk2_9cd38877:

    # Y "如果有更好的消遣时间的办法我也想换一种。"
    Y "If there were a better way to pass the time,  I might as well try that."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:178
translate english talk2_2db1beda:

    # "度过了一段愉快（？）的时光。"
    "They had spent a pleasant (?) time."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:180
translate english talk2_bb9e3c10:

    # "L离开了。"
    "L left the cell."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:185
translate english talk3_01736df9:

    # "L打开囚室的门走了进来，月正在低着头发呆，听见动静抬头看了L一眼，然后又重新低头继续发呆了。"
    "L opened the door and stepped inside. Light sat with his head down, dazed. Heard the sound, he glanced up at L, then dropped his gaze again, sinking back into a blank stare."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:187
translate english talk3_9b4fcd17:

    # L "……"
    L "..."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:189
translate english talk3_27367f8c:

    # Y "你又来干什么？"
    Y "What do you want this time?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:191
translate english talk3_8b1f8267:

    # L "夜神君有什么想吃的东西吗？"
    L "Is there anything you would like to eat, Yagami-kun?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:193
translate english talk3_72794874:

    # Y jiaoji2 "你什么意思？想可怜我吗？以为我是你豢养的宠物吗？关在笼子里喂食然后欣赏漂亮的羽毛？"
    Y jiaoji2 "What's that supposed to mean? Trying to pity me? Don't you think I'm some pet of yours—locked in a cage, fed scraps, just so you can admire my pretty feathers?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:195
translate english talk3_06c363c5:

    # "月讽刺地笑了。"
    "Light let out a mocking laugh."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:197
translate english talk3_50659924:

    # Y "滚。我什么都不需要。"
    Y "Get out. I don't need anything."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:199
translate english talk3_e936bae5:

    # "L没有离开。"
    "But L didn't leave."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:201
translate english talk3_52c97e30:

    # L unhappy "我没有把夜神君当成宠物，这一点夜神君可以相信我。"
    L unhappy "Yagami-kun, I don't see you as a pet. Please believe me on this."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:203
translate english talk3_14406234:

    # "月只是冷冷地看着L。"
    "Light stared back at L coldly."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:205
translate english talk3_1b8cbcd2:

    # "L丧失了交流的欲望，偶尔升起的逗弄心思被青年敏锐地发现，然后针对性地回击，让他不太开心。"
    "L lost interest in talking, because sometimes when he tried to tease a little, the young man would notice right away and strike back."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:209
translate english talk3_01a3c825:

    # "L离开了囚室。"
    "L turned and left the room."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:215
translate english talk4_cba602c2:

    # L "夜神君醒着吗？"
    L "Yagami-kun, are you awake?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:217
translate english talk4_70b9feb8:

    # Y ditou "……嗯"
    Y ditou "...Yeah."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:219
translate english talk4_53c7a4a0:

    # "青年的语气很没精神。不过也是常理吧，任何人被这样关在囚室里面都不会很有精神的。"
    "The young man's voice was drained. Understandable—anyone locked up like this would act the same."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:221
translate english talk4_92a3967c:

    # Y Light "你要把我关到什么时候？你的目的究竟是什么？"
    Y Light "How long are you going to keep me here? What do you really want from me?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:223
translate english talk4_bbc94eb9:

    # L "我不能给夜神君一个准确的期限。"
    L "I can't give you an exact timeframe, Yagami-kun."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:225
translate english talk4_8b4aec59:

    # Y smile2 "这样折磨我就是你的目的吗？"
    Y smile2 "So this—torturing me—is that your purpose?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:227
translate english talk4_f133b276:

    # "青年讽刺地笑了两声，不再搭理L了。"
    "The young man gave a short, bitter laugh and refused to say more."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:232
translate english talk5_ef4040ba:

    # "L走进囚室的时候，月正坐在床上发呆，视线的焦距空茫地散开，听到响声后才抬头看向L。"
    "When L entered, Light was sitting on the bed, his gaze unfocused, lost in emptiness. He only looked up at L when he heard the sound."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:232
translate english talk5_f962d0a6:

    # "褐发青年只是沉默着，等待侦探先表明来意。"
    "The brown-haired young man stayed silent, waiting for the detective to speak first."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:232
translate english talk5_838b99f9:

    # "L和往常一样开门见山地开口了。"
    "As always, L got straight to the point."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:238
translate english talk5_5422ba95:

    # L order2 "夜神君，你对弥海砂小姐的结局不好奇吗？你们不是情侣关系吗？"
    L order2 "Yagami-kun, aren't you curious what happened to Misa-san? Weren't you two in a relationship?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:240
translate english talk5_c40422d0:

  
    # Y "别说得像我想知道就可以知道一样，我只是一个阶下囚不是吗，没有额外的信息获取渠道。"
  
    Y "Don't say it like I can just know if I want to. I'm nothing but a prisoner, remember? I have no way of getting extra information."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:244
translate english talk5_a35dcbc2:

    # L pt "夜神君也不用每句话都这样话里带刺吧，我可是考虑到你的心情才过来询问的。"
    L pt "Yagami-kun, You don't have to make everything sound so harsh. I only came here out of consideration for your feelings."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:246
translate english talk5_9640895b:

    
    # Y "我都已经在这里了，海砂又能好到哪里去？"
    
    Y "I've already ended up here, how well could Misa be doing?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:250
translate english talk5_01370c1e:

    # L "说得也是呢。"
    L "That's true."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:252
translate english talk5_bb368991:

    # L "其实在夜神君被逮捕的第一时间，弥小姐得到消息之后，就跳桥自杀了。"
    L "In fact, right after Yagami-kun was arrested, Misa-san heard the news... and jumped off a bridge."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:254
translate english talk5_27cdae4c:

    # "月一瞬间露出了惊讶的表情，久久不语。"
    "For an instant, surprise flashed across Light's face. Then he fell silent for a long time."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:256
translate english talk5_3b8d08f6:

    # Y "能以自己的意志结束生命……我竟然还有羡慕她的时候啊。"
    Y "To be able to end her life by her own will… there are moments when I actually find myself envying her."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:259
translate english talk5_181e8bcc:

    # Y "所以，你把这个消息告诉我是为了什么？想让我表演自杀给你看吗？"
    Y "So, why tell me this? You want me to put on a suicide show for you?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:267
translate english talk5_705cb56e:

    # L unhappy "夜神君也不用对我这么有敌意吧，你现在还活着不是多亏了我吗？"
    L unhappy "Yagami-kun, you don't have to be this hostile. You're still alive because of me, aren't you?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:269
translate english talk5_0ae45ad7:

    # Y "那只是你对我有所谋求不是吗？难道你是那种做好事不留名的圣人？"
    Y "You only came to me because you wanted something, didn't you? Don't tell me you're one of those saints who do good stuff without leaving their name."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:271
translate english talk5_70554eca:

    # L pt "这周本来应该是死刑立即执行下达的日子。"
    L pt "This week was supposed to be the time of your immediate execution."

