    # "脆弱之处被人捏在手里的感觉糟糕透了，尤其是在膀胱充盈的情况下，他甚至不敢用更大的音量发泄情绪。"
    "The feeling of having such a vulnerable organ held in someone's hand was awful, especially when he badly needed to use the toilet, he didn't even dare to raise his voice to vent his emotions."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:457
translate english talk6_0fe13556:

    # L "如果我拒绝呢。"
    L "What if I refuse?  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:459
translate english talk6_b9fa487f:

    # "L的声音依然平静，语调没有起伏，月硬是从中听出了几分看戏的意思。"
    "L's voice remained calm, without fluctuation, although Light detected a hint of amusement in it.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:459
translate english talk6_22ed2310:

    # "要怎么办？违抗L？自己有办法做到吗？在这种情况下？月绞尽脑汁想着除了屈服以外的解决方法，俊美的五官微微扭曲，显得有些狰狞。"
    "What to do? Attack L? Was there any way he could do that? Under these circumstances? Light racked his brains for a way out other than giving in, his handsome features twisting slightly into something almost grim. "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:459
translate english talk6_6668787c:

    # "两人就这样沉默着对峙了几秒钟，也可能是十几秒钟。"
    "The two stood in silent confrontation for a few seconds, or perhaps over ten seconds.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:459
translate english talk6_262e60aa:

    # "月的胸膛起伏着，呼吸声清晰可闻。最终他闭上了眼睛，放任了下腹处的排泄冲动。"
    "Light's chest heaved, his breathing audible. Finally, he closed his eyes and gave in to the urge to release from his lower abdomen.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:459
translate english talk6_ee5d8202:

    # "淅淅沥沥的水声明晃晃地昭示着屈辱，被当做还无法自主排泄的稚童对待，月只能忍耐。"
    "The trickling sound of water blatantly signaled humiliation. Treated like a young child unable to pee on his own, Light could only endure.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:474
translate english talk6_fefc6a5c:

    # "夜神月想，他究竟还要忍到什么时候？"
    "Light wondered, how much longer would he have to endure?  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:474
translate english talk6_ca8870a0:

    # "如果说之前主动放弃关于死亡笔记的记忆，被关押50天是为了彻底洗清嫌疑，杀死L，这个目标能让他一直忍下去，"
    "If giving up his memories of the Death Note and being locked up for fifty days was to completely clear suspicion and kill L, then that goal was what kept him enduring.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:474
translate english talk6_46c00b1d:

    # "那现在已经败北的他，究竟还要忍耐到什么时候？"
    "But now, defeated as he was, how much longer should he endure?  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:474
translate english talk6_d9292a7b:

    # "他已经没有可以通过忍耐到达的光明未来，如今他已经身处深渊，那未来是无光之地。"
    "He no longer had a bright future to reach through just endurance. Now he had fallen into the abyss, where the future was a lightless place.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:474
translate english talk6_11abcd84:

    # "他现在已经什么都不剩下了，无论是死亡笔记，身份，人权，还是尊严。"
    "He had nothing left now—no Death Note, his identity, his human rights, and even his dignity.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:474
translate english talk6_eff4a0a2:

    # "不能再想了，月脸上的表情变得麻木，只有钝感才可以对抗绝望，让他不至于坠入漆黑的水中溺死。"
    "He couldn't think anymore. Light's expression grew numb. Only numbness could combat despair, preventing him from falling into the dark sea and drowning.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:486
translate english talk6_98d1a48a:

    # L "已经可以了，你做得很好，夜神君。"
    L "That's enough. You did well, Yagami-kun.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:488
translate english talk6_ffcbf828:

    # Y angry "……"
    Y angry "……"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:490
translate english talk6_ba29d7f1:

    # L "不需要想那么多，只有活下来，你现在才会苦恼这些，不是吗？"
    L "You don't need to overthink it. It's exactly because you want to survive that you're troubled by all this, isn't that right?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:492
translate english talk6_ce4442e5:

    # "这句话轻轻拉了一下月，让他不至于完全陷入虚无的绝望中。"
    "These words gently pulled Light back, keeping him from falling completely into nihilistic despair.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:492
translate english talk6_1ac353f6:

    # "月的眼神变得有些复杂，他想说些什么，在脑内组织语言时，突然感到自己的头被摸了一下。"
    "Light's gaze became somewhat complex. He wanted to say something, but as he was organizing his thoughts, he felt a gentle pat on his head.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:492
translate english talk6_2a72b1ee:

    # "L有些发凉的手指穿过发丝，收回的时候碰到了月的后颈，带来轻微的麻痹感。"
    "L's somewhat cold fingers brushed through his hair, and as they withdrew, they touched the nape of Light's neck, bringing a slight numb sensation.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:492
translate english talk6_cf2bf6f8:

    # "月忘了自己想说什么，怔了一下。然后他们无言地收拾好卫生，L重新给月戴上镣铐。"
    "Light forgot what he wanted to say, pausing for a moment. Then L wordlessly cleaned up, and re-shackled Light.  "

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:502
translate english talk6_1ad06338:

    # "月沉默地坐在床边，后颈处仍然有发麻的错觉。"
    "Light sat silently on the edge of the bed, the nape of his neck still tingling with a phantom sensation."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:506
translate english talk7_4f5bb460:

    # "L收到了月的对话请求，夜神月在监控里说有问题想问他。"
    "L received a conversation request from Light Yagami, who mentioned in the surveillance that he had a question to ask."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:506
translate english talk7_af493998:

    # "怀着一丝好奇心，L进入了囚室。"
    "Driven by a flicker of curiosity, L entered the cell."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:506
translate english talk7_7f1bf226:

    # "月没有从床边起身，只是抬起头，直视L的眼睛。连日的审判和监禁让他的脸颊有些消瘦，头发也长长了些，更显骨相俊美锋利。"
    "Light did not rise from the bedside but simply lifted his head, staring directly at L. The prolonged trials and imprisonment had thinned his cheeks slightly, and his hair had grown longer, accentuating his sharp, handsome bone structure."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:511
translate english talk7_ad34a448:

    # L "所以，夜神君想问什么？"
    L "So, what does Yagami-kun want to ask?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:513
translate english talk7_dcccff68:

    # Y "对你来说可能不是什么大事，但是对我来说很重要。"
    Y "It may not be a big deal to you, but it's important to me."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:515
translate english talk7_905ea644:

    # Y "我想知道……母亲和妆裕现在怎么样了？"
    Y "I want to know… how are my mother and Sayu now?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:517
translate english talk7_da864f5d:

    # "L对于月跳过了夜神总一郎毫不意外，这位优等生的父亲是Kira事件日本警方的核心人物，在夜神月被抓捕时他就在现场，却因为血缘关系被排挤在抓捕行动之外。"
    "L was not surprised that Light skipped over Soichiro Yagami. The model student's father was a central figure in the Japanese police force's investigation into Kira."
    " When Light was arrested, Soichiro was present at the scene but was excluded from the operation due to his blood relationship."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:517
translate english talk7_2e117277:

    # "夜神总一郎是一位能够大义灭亲的正派人物，他对Kira案的贡献有目共睹，但在警视厅内部遭到了明升暗降，最后他自己决定辞职，提前从刑警生涯退休了。"
    "Soichiro Yagami was a righteous man capable of sacrificing his own family for greater principles. His contributions to the Kira case were undeniable, but within the police department, he was kicked upstairs."
    "Eventually, he chose to resign and retire early from his career as a detective."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:521
translate english talk7_3aacd076:

    # L order2 "健康方面的话，夜神君不用担心。令堂和令妹虽然大受打击，但是也没有到生病住院的程度。"
    L order2 "Health-wise Yagami-kun needn't worry. Your mother and sister were deeply affected, but it hasn't reached the point of illness or hospitalization."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:523
translate english talk7_11d426be:

    # L "具体的情况我并不清楚，以我的身份也不适合拜访夜神家吧。"
    L "I'm unclear on the specific details, and it would be inappropriate for me to visit the Yagami's household given my position."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:525
translate english talk7_a3dd719e:

    # L "说一句很残忍的话，虽然夜神君活下来了，但是最好绝了之后再联系她们的念头。"
    L "To say something cruel, while Yagami-kun survived, it might be better to abandon any thought of contacting them again in future."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:527
translate english talk7_3078655f:

    # L "这对你和对她们来说都有益处。"
    L "It would be for the benefit of both you and them."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:529
translate english talk7_ccd4fe60:

    # "夜神月听完之后低下了头，沉默了许久。"
    "After hearing this, Light lowered his head, remaining silent for a long time."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:529
translate english talk7_7e86acb0:

    # "他的脸上极少流露出这种有些哀伤的表情，不过一眨眼的功夫，这脆弱的一面就如同冰雪融化般消失了。"
    "It was rare for him to display such a sorrowful expression, but in the blink of an eye, this fragile side disappeared, melting away like snow."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:539
translate english talk7_1f4b7ebb:

    # L pt "……如果夜神君真的很思念家人的话，之后在远处看一眼还是可以做到的。"
    L pt "…If Yagami-kun truly misses his family, it's still possible to see them from a distance later."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:541
translate english talk7_0879371d:

    # "月冲L投去了混合着惊讶和疑惑的目光。"
    "Light cast L a gaze filled with a mix of surprise and confusion."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:541
translate english talk7_7276ac34:

    # "自己还能有从这监牢里出去的那天？夜神君大概是这个意思吧，L心想。"
    "Did he mean that he could still leave this prison one day? That was probably what he was thinking, L mused."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:545
translate english talk7_3266e031:

    # Y fadai "……谢谢。"
    Y fadai "...Thank you."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:547
translate english talk7_59d18323:

    # Y Light "我估计让父亲和母亲很失望吧……"
    Y Light "I guess I've really disappointed my father and mother..."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:549
translate english talk7_9bad42ae:

    # Y "幸好他们还有妆裕。"
    Y "Thankfully, they still have Sayu."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:551
translate english talk7_cbd4b11e:

    # Y "我的事情没有牵连到妆裕，大概是我唯一庆幸的事情。"
    Y "The fact that my situation didn't implicate Sayu is probably the only thing I can be thankful for."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:553
translate english talk7_019a14f1:

    # "月的语气中带着强烈的苦涩意味，他的嘴角抽动了一下，想要微笑却失败了，只能维持原本冷漠的表情。"
    "Light's tone was filled with bitterness, and his mouth twitched as if attempting a smile but failing, settling instead into his usual indifferent look."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:553
translate english talk7_55e044e8:

    # "这确实是不幸中的万幸，涉及到死亡笔记这种超自然力量，一旦这件事被有心人得知，夜神幸子和夜神妆裕是首当其冲会被当做人质用来勒索死亡笔记的存在。"
    "That is indeed a luck in misfortune. With the supernatural power of the Death Note involved, if this matter were discovered by malicious individuals, Sachiko Yagami and Sayu Yagami would be the primary targets to be taken hostage for extorting the Death Note."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:553
translate english talk7_d602e42d:

    # "因为夜神总一郎和夜神月是搜查总部的核心人物，虽然搜查在秘密进行，但是从日本警视厅那边查起，得知部分人员的情报并不困难。"
    "Because Soichiro Yagami and Light Yagami were core figures in the investigation, even though the investigation was conducted secretly, starting from the Japanese NPA and obtaining information on some personnel wouldn't be difficult."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:553
translate english talk7_a0f16920:

    # "L不擅长面对这种场面，也不知道要怎么接夜神月的这句话，于是只能保持沉默。"
    "L was not good at handling these kinds of situations and didn't know how to respond to Light's comment, so he could only remain silent."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:553
translate english talk7_f86c2b64:

    # "月也没有为难他，自己主动开口："
    "Light didn't push him either. Instead, he spoke it up himself:"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:564
translate english talk7_fc480257:

    # Y smile2 "谢谢你跟我说这些。"
    Y smile2 "Thank you for telling me this."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:567
translate english talk7_8baf3037:

    # Y "怎么说……我本以为你是个更加自我和冷漠的人。"
    Y "Somehow… I thought you were a more self-centered and indifferent person."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:569
translate english talk7_a040c03e:

    # L "这是在夸我还是骂我？"
    L "Is that a compliment or an insult?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:571
translate english talk7_8f027157:

    # "这次月顺畅地翘起嘴角，露出一个浅淡的微笑。"
    "This time, Light smoothly raised the corner of his mouth into a slight smile."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:577
translate english talk7_895c0ee3:

    # L order1 "夜神君现在觉得后怕了？以你的聪明程度肯定想过事情暴露后最糟糕的结局吧？"
    L order1 "Are you now feeling regret now, Yagami-kun? With your intelligence, you must have considered the worst possible outcome once everything was exposed, right?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:581
translate english talk7_573922d6:

    # L "当时你把你的家人当成什么了？成神之路所必须的牺牲品？"
    L "What did you consider your family as back then? Necessary sacrifices on the path to becoming the god?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:583
translate english talk7_7eecbb0a:

    # "月的脸色霎时间变得非常难看，他确实考虑过最糟糕的情况，但是他同样有自信不会沦落到那个境地。"
    "Light's expression suddenly darkened. He had indeed considered the worst-case scenario, but he was also confident that he wouldn't fall to that extent."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:583
translate english talk7_18ebcc1c:

    # "死亡笔记这种死神所持有的神器是普通人可以驾驭的吗？如果没有这份决心，怎么可能最大限度地使用这本笔记？"
    "Could an ordinary person wield the Death Note, an artifact of Shinigami? Without that determination, how could anyone maximize the power of the note?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:587
translate english talk7_4102fd23:

    # Y jiaoji1 "你和我们家是什么关系，有什么资格说这句话，对没有发生的事情指指点点？"
    Y jiaoji1 "What relation do you have to my family? What gives you the right to point fingers at things that never happened?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:589
translate english talk7_ad0f1f01:

    # Y "预设一个我把全家人害死的悲惨结局然后进行道德绑架？这就是你的手段吗？"
    Y "Presupposing a tragic ending where I would harm my entire family, and then trying to morally blackmail me? Is that your tactic?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:591
translate english talk7_0010684a:

    # Y "难道你当世界侦探到处出警的时候就是绝对安全的吗？你的亲人，和你有关系的人就完全不会被罪犯报复吗？"
    Y "Do you think you're completely safe while the world's detectives are out on the job? Do you think your family and those connected to you are completely immune to retaliation from criminals?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:593
translate english talk7_93f6ab96:

    # Y "别太自大了，L，把运气当成自己的能力，觉得自己就是世界中心，你以为自己是正义女神的化身吗？"
    Y "Don't get too arrogant, L. Mistaking luck for your own ability, thinking you're the center of the world—do you think you're the embodiment of justice?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:595
translate english talk7_5b7eb025:

    # "这场对话没法再进行下去了，只能落得一个不欢而散的结局。"
    "There was no way this conversation could continue, and it ended on an unpleasant note."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:600
translate english talk7_01a3c825:

    # "L离开了囚室。"
    "L left the cell."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:606
translate english talk_repeat_0d5f5581:

    # "L和月在对话中度过了愉快的（？）几个小时。"
    "L and Light spent a few pleasant(?) hours in conversation."

