# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:68
translate english talk1_e2ab0f90:

    # Y renzhen "别开玩笑了，L，如果没有发生意外，“Kira”这种等级的囚犯怎么可能随意移动？究竟发生了什么？"
    Y renzhen "Stop joking, L. If nothing went wrong, how could a prisoner with Kira's identity be moved so casually? What exactly happened?"

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:242
translate english talk5_d449bd6d:

    # Y "别说得像我想知道就可以知道一样，我只是一个阶下囚不是吗，没有额外的信息获取渠道。"
    Y "Don't say it like I can just know if I want to. I'm nothing but a prisoner, remember? I have no way of getting extra information."

# game/script/daily_talk.rpy:248
translate english talk5_851f1210:

    # Y "我都已经在这里了，海砂又能好到哪里去？"
    Y "I've already ended up here, how well could Misa be doing?"

