    # "月的脸色霎时间变得非常难看，他确实考虑过最糟糕的情况，但是他同样有自信不会沦落到那个境地。"
    "Light's expression suddenly darkened. He had indeed considered the worst-case scenario, but he was also confident that he wouldn't fall to that extent."

